  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating low-carbon circular economy through cleantech innovation towards sustainable development in Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is to promote the acceleration of high-impact clean technology innovation mobilizing private sector initiatives for scale up, climate action, and creation of green jobs, contributing GHG emission reductions, especially focusing on deployment of integrated waste management systems and solutions including waste recovery and waste to energy in major cities of Pakistan</narrative>
  </description>
